  unitName: Patriotic Scholar Emily (EU)
  unitId: 730264
  unitNumber: 7220
  description: An erudite at the service of the Republic, this young girl dedicated
    her life to books and knowledge. Her thirst for knowledge is matched only by
    her affection for the Republic. Although she spends most of her time in the library,
    she readily joins the battlefront when necessary. Her devotion will have her
    cross paths with the group of hunters, who she joined with no hesitation. Emily
    was delighted to be able to experience a historic event that she then recorded
    with precision for the history books.
  summonDesc: I want to become part of the history of the Republic!
  fusionDesc: "I must take notes! We must tell the future generations\u2026"
